{
  "_README": "Consumed by `bun scripts/update-grammars.ts` (via OpenTUI updateAssets). Downloads prebuilt grammar .wasm + nvim-treesitter highlights.scm into assets/grammars/. NETWORK REQUIRED; assets are not committed. Pin/bump the tree-sitter-wasms version as needed. Add languages by appending entries; the runtime picks up any subdir with a .wasm + highlights.scm (see src/ui/repl-solid/syntax.ts).",
